# Driveely / portfolio — always push to main

When working on the Driveely product (`driveely.app`) in the `portfolio` repo:

1. Target repo: `quentinbouyssou82-svg/portfolio`
2. Target branch: **`main` only** (no feature branches unless explicitly requested)
3. After any fix that should hit production: **commit and push to `main` in the same session**
4. Do not stop at local-only changes or localhost verification alone
5. Confirm on `https://driveely.app` when the change is auth/routing/middleware related
6. Vercel project serving the product domain: **`margeo`** (same repo also has a `portfolio` Vercel project — product domain is `driveely.app`)

Never leave production-critical Driveely fixes unpushed.
